There is a large window in the room.
Near the window is a wooden desk.
A chair is also kept with the desk.
This place is for my work.
My black bag is lying on the floor.
I pick up my bag from the floor.
My laptop is in the bag.
I slowly take the laptop out.
I put the laptop on the desk.
Now the laptop is kept in front of the window.
There are some notebooks inside the bag too.
I take the notebooks out too.
I put them near the laptop.
A small lamp is kept on top of the desk.
I put my pen near the lamp.
The bag is empty now.
The empty bag is lying under the desk.
My work corner is now ready.
Everything is in its place.
